{{PageBanner|Pikobanner.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the popular television personality and entertainer known as '''Daimaou Kosaka''' (古坂和仁, ''Kosaka Kazuhito'', '''Kazuhito Kosaka''') was held from December 22nd, 2016 to January 5th, 2017. The collaboration includes an exclusive stage and stamps going on during collaboration the period.

==Event Information==
The Battle Cats join {{Color|#FF0000|'''Musical Sensation PIKOTARO'''}} for a special collaboration event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from December 22, 2016 (11:00) to January 5, 2017(10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Collab Stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Take on Pikotaro as a special enemy in "Pen-Pineapple-Apple-Pen"!<br>
Tap on the Stories of Legend/Event Stages section at the Title Menu to take the challenge and get the Limited Rare Unit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}}[[PIKOTARO (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Pikotaro'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''"'''}} upon stage clear!<br>
Plus, pick up a bonus reward of {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food'''}} the first time you clear the stage!<br>
<small><small>※"Pikotaro" can be unlocked by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※If the Pikotaro map does not appear, you may need to upgrade to the most recent versions of The Battle Cats app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Login every day during the Collab Event for bonus login rewards!'''}}<br>
Special Login Stamps, available to collect only during this event!<br>
Login each day during this collaboration to pick up every stamp and get Rare Tickets, battle items and other rewards!<br>
<small><small>※You must upgrade to the most recent versions of The Battle Cats app to collect these rewards.<br>
※There are 7 total login stamps to collect during this campaign. Collect them all!</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Join our social media share campaign! Get a Collab-only Special Cat!'''}}<br>
The Battle Cats + Pikotaro are hosting a share campaign on Facebook and Instagram, and we're asking users of all versions of The Battle Cats worldwide to help out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''★How to Participate★'''}}<br>
