③If the video posts reach 100,000 shares, all users will be able to collect the Special Cat Unit {{Color|#FF0000|'''"'''}}[[CPAC (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''CPAC'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|'''"!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Click the links below to Share the post/video↓'''}}<br>
